.TH DRAW_POINT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
draw_point \- Single logical pixel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdraw.h\(dq
.BI "void draw_point(float x, float y, Color c);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Single logical pixel. Fine for stars and sparse particles; for many pixels a tiny sprite or draw_rect with w = h = 1 costs the same.
.SH MODULE
draw (src/engine/draw/draw.h)
